---
description: Проверить или выбрать клиент вызова, подключить или отключить клиента проекта через ITL
agent: code
---

For `attach`, `detach`, or `reconcile`, use the clean `master` worktree. `attach` adds one explicit client and `detach` removes one, including the last client without deleting the project. `reconcile` reapplies the configured set. `switch` selects an already attached client for this invocation only and does not change project membership; later calls identify their client again or pass `-AgentTarget`. `status` reads the configured set. Then run:

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\.agents\skills\1c-workflow\scripts\run-itl-command.ps1 -- -Action itl-switch-client -Mode <status|switch|attach|detach|reconcile> [-Client <client>]
```

The helper owns snapshot, guards, scoped cleanup, pinned rules installation, and reload instructions. Existing client model settings remain intact. Use the bounded JSON summary as the result; read only the last 80 lines of its `logPath` on failure. Do not update development worktrees or remove RTK integration manually.
